
flowchart TD
    UI[UI / Dashboard / Form]
    SDK[Tevroc SDK Entities]
    Worker[Tevroc Worker]
    DB[(Data Store)]
    Cache[Local Cache / Sync]

    UI -->|create / query / update| SDK
    SDK -->|entity request| Worker
    Worker --> DB
    SDK -->|cache operations| Cache
    Cache -->|sync| Worker

    style UI fill:#0f172a,color:#fff
    style SDK fill:#1e293b,color:#fff
    style Worker fill:#111827,color:#fff
    style DB fill:#0f172a,color:#fff
    style Cache fill:#1e293b,color:#fff
